#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:774
msgid ""
"Add this to <code>~/.cursor/mcp.json</code> (create the file if it does not "
"exist), then reload Cursor:"
msgstr ""
"이것을 <code>~/.cursor/mcp.json</code>에 추가하고(파일이 없으면 생성), Cursor"
"를 다시 로드하세요:"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:795
msgid "Copy setup command"
msgstr "설정 명령 복사"

#. translators: %s: the MCP server name shown in the client.
#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:806
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Open a new Claude Code session and run <code>/mcp</code> — <code>%s</code> "
"should be listed as connected."
msgstr ""
"새 Claude Code 세션을 열고 <code>/mcp</code>를 실행하세요 — <code>%s</code>이"
"(가) 연결됨으로 표시되어야 합니다."

#. translators: %s: the MCP server name shown in the client.
#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:808
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Run <code>codex mcp list</code> — <code>%s</code> should appear in the list."
msgstr ""
"<code>codex mcp list</code>를 실행하세요 — <code>%s</code>이(가) 목록에 표시"
"되어야 합니다."

#. translators: %s: the MCP server name shown in the client.
#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:810
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Restart Opencode and ask it to list its MCP servers — <code>%s</code> should "
"be available."
msgstr ""
"Opencode를 다시 시작하고 MCP 서버 목록을 표시하도록 요청하세요 — <code>%s</"
"code>을(를) 사용할 수 있어야 합니다."

#. translators: %s: the MCP server name shown in the client.
#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:812
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Open <code>Cursor Settings → MCP</code> — <code>%s</code> should appear with "
"a green status dot."
msgstr ""
"<code>Cursor Settings → MCP</code>를 여세요 — <code>%s</code>이(가) 녹색 상"
"태 점과 함께 표시되어야 합니다."

#. translators: %s: the MCP server name shown in the client.
#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:814
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Run <code>gemini mcp list</code> — <code>%s</code> should show as connected."
msgstr ""
"<code>gemini mcp list</code>를 실행하세요 — <code>%s</code>이(가) 연결됨으로 "
"표시되어야 합니다."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:821
msgid "Check it worked"
msgstr "작동 확인"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:834
msgid "Existing keys"
msgstr "기존 키"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin.php:839 admin/class-mcp-admin.php:1380
